STATUS OF THIS FILE
-------------------
This is the licence that applies to Firekeep TODAY, while the repository is
private and the software has not been distributed to anyone. It is deliberately
restrictive and deliberately provisional.

The intended commercial model is OPEN-CORE: a permissively-licensed client kit
and single-user core, with team features licensed commercially. That decision is
recorded as pending in docs/LICENSING.md and has not been made. When it is, this
file is replaced — and the replacement, not this file, is what any customer
receives.

Do not treat this file as the commercial licence. It grants a customer nothing,
which is correct while there are no customers and wrong the moment there is one.

